---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	title: "Sundial Support",
	description:
		"Support for Sundial (晷), the screen time app for iPhone and iPad — permissions, limits, active hours, widgets, purchases and data.",
	ogImage: "/og/sundial-en.png",
	ogImageAlt:
		"The Sundial app icon, the line 'A limit should feel like a sundial.', and an iPhone showing the Today screen with an ink-wash landscape.",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<div class="space-y-6">
		<p class="text-sm">
			<a class="cactus-link" href="/sundial/">← Back to Sundial</a>
		</p>
		<h1 class="title">Sundial — Support</h1>
		<p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
			Help for Sundial (晷), the screen time app for iPhone and iPad.
		</p>

		<div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-5 dark:border-gray-700">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Contact</h2>
			<p class="mt-2">
				Email <a href="mailto:zuoxiaooo@icloud.com"
					><span>zuoxiaooo</span><span>@</span><span>icloud.com</span></a
				> — please include your iOS version and what you expected to happen. You can also use
				<strong>Settings → Feedback</strong> inside the app.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-2 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
				邮件联系 <a href="mailto:zuoxiaooo@icloud.com"
					><span>zuoxiaooo</span><span>@</span><span>icloud.com</span></a
				>，或在 App 内的「设置 → 反馈」中告诉我们。
			</p>
		</div>

		<h2 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold">Screen Time permission</h2>
		<p>
			Sundial reads your usage and blocks apps through Apple's Screen Time framework. Without that
			permission the app can show nothing and limit nothing. If you declined it, or revoked it
			later, turn it back on in
			<strong>Settings → Screen Time → Sundial</strong>.
		</p>
		<p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
			晷通过 Apple 的「屏幕时间」框架读取用量并屏蔽 App。没有该权限，App
			无法显示数据也无法限制。如果曾拒绝 或撤销，请在<strong>设置 → 屏幕时间 → 晷</strong
			>中重新开启。
		</p>

		<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Why does the widget show more time than I actually used?</h2>
		<p>
			If <em>Share Across Devices</em> is on, Apple includes usage from other devices signed in to the
			same Apple ID — a Mac, for example — in the activity Sundial's monitor receives, and Apple gives
			apps no way to scope that to one device. The daily report inside the app is limited to this device.
			To make the two agree, turn <em>Share Across Devices</em> off in <strong
				>Settings → Screen Time</strong
			>.
		</p>
		<p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
			如果开启了「跨设备共享」，Apple 会把同一 Apple ID 下其它设备（例如
			Mac）的用量也算进晷后台收到的数据 里，而 Apple 没有给 App 按设备筛选这些事件的能力。App
			内的日报只统计这台设备。想让两者一致，请在
			<strong>设置 → 屏幕时间</strong>中关闭「跨设备共享」。
		</p>

		<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">What are active hours and Lock now?</h2>
		<p>
			Every limit can run all day, or only inside a window you draw — 9:00 to 18:00, for example.
			Outside that window nothing counts and nothing is shielded. <strong>Lock now</strong>
			turns the rule into a zero-minute limit, so its apps are shielded the moment you save it instead
			of after an allowance is spent. A windowed rule simply stops counting when the window closes, and
			every rule resets at midnight.
		</p>
		<p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
			每条限额都可以全天生效，也可以只在你划出的时段内生效——例如 9:00 到
			18:00。时段之外不计时，也不拦截。<strong>立即锁定</strong>会把规则变成一个 0
			分钟额度，保存的那一刻就锁住这些
			App，而不必等到额度用完。所有规则都会在午夜重置。
		</p>

		<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">What happens when a limit runs out?</h2>
		<p>
			iOS shields the apps in that rule. The shield shows what you finished and the reason you set
			for the rule, and offers three ways on: <em>I'm Done</em> (keeps the limit), <em
				>15 more minutes</em
			>, or
			<em>Remove Limit</em> for the rest of the day. Limits reset at midnight.
		</p>
		<p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
			到时间点，该规则里的 App
			会被系统屏蔽。屏蔽页会显示你今天完成了多少、以及你为该规则设定的理由，并给出 三个出口：<em
				>今天到此为止</em
			>（保留限额）、<em>再玩一刻钟</em>、或今天<em>解除限制</em>。限额在每天 00:00 重置。
		</p>

		<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Purchases</h2>
		<p>
			Sundial Pro is a one-time purchase, not a subscription — there is nothing to cancel. If Pro
			does not appear after buying or restoring, open <strong
				>Settings → Sundial Pro → Restore Purchase</strong
			>. Purchases are tied to your Apple ID; billing is handled by Apple.
		</p>
		<p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
			晷 Pro 是一次性买断，不是订阅，因此无需取消。若购买或恢复后没有解锁，请打开
			<strong>设置 → 晷 Pro → 恢复购买</strong>。购买与 Apple ID 绑定，由 Apple 处理账单。
		</p>

		<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">My data</h2>
		<p>
			Usage, limits and settings live only on your device — there is no account and no server.
			Deleting the app removes them; removing individual limits or changing the theme does too. See
			the
			<a href="/sundial/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
		</p>
		<p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
			用量、限额与设置只保存在你的设备上，没有账号也没有服务器。删除 App
			即可清除这些数据，删除单条限额 或更换主题同理。详见<a href="/sundial/privacy/">隐私政策</a>。
		</p>

		<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Requirements</h2>
		<p>
			iPhone or iPad with iOS 18.5 or later. Sundial runs on both, and it does not track other
			devices or people.
		</p>
		<p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
			需要 iOS 18.5 或更高版本的 iPhone 或 iPad。Sundial 同时支持两者，也不会监控其它设备或他人。
		</p>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
